{"seq":2,"slug":"exchange-inventory-hold-availability","title":"换货库存预留与可得性（联034）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/exchange-transaction-inventory/exchange-inventory-hold-availability","wordCount":1956,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"换货库存预留与可得性-联034\">换货库存预留与可得性（联034）</h1><p>「系统说可以换，但换不了」是换货流程里最伤转化的一句话。它的成因几乎总是同一个：换货单创建时没有检查目标变体的库存，等到拣货时才发现缺货。跨境场景下这个缺口还要乘以一次跨境运输的时间——买家可能等了两周，最后被告知换不了，此时他已经错过了别处购买或接受退款的窗口。这一篇处理的就是「预占什么时候发生、占多久、什么时候释放」这三个问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-换货为什么必须预占而非后置校验\">核心概念：换货为什么必须预占而非后置校验</h2><h3 id=\"预占时长的结构性差异\">预占时长的结构性差异</h3><p>普通销售单的库存路径是「下单即预占，支付成功转实占，超时释放」。换货单看起来可以简化：反正货已经在卖家手里，等确定要换了再扣。但这个简化的前提是错的，因为换货单的创建与执行之间隔着一段时间——逆向件要收回、客服要审批、价差要结算。如果不预占，这段时间里同一单位的库存可以卖给别的买家，结果就是预占顺序变成了先到先得的竞态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"预占必须能解释自己的结束\">预占必须能解释自己的结束</h3><p>更关键的是，换货单的<strong>预占时长天然比销售单长</strong>。销售单的预占通常几十分钟内就会结算（支付或超时）；换货单的预占要跨越逆向物流，可能是 7 到 21 天。这带来一个直接后果：预占必须有独立的到期时间与明确的释放路径，而且释放不能只靠定时任务兜底——业务上的取消、拒绝、超时都要能主动触发释放。一篇好的库存预留设计的判据很简单：<strong>任何一条预占记录，都必须能在不看日志的情况下回答「它是怎么结束的」</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[创建换货单] --&gt; B{目标变体可得?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[拒绝换货&lt;br/&gt;建议退款或候补]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[创建预占&lt;br/&gt;RESERVED]&#10;  D --&gt; E{逆向件到达?}&#10;  E --&gt;|超时未到| F[释放预占&lt;br/&gt;EXPIRED]&#10;  E --&gt;|到达并质检通过| G[预占转实占&lt;br/&gt;CONSUMED]&#10;  E --&gt;|到达但质检不通过| H[释放预占&lt;br/&gt;RELEASED]&#10;  D --&gt; I{客服拒绝/买家取消}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| H&#10;  G --&gt; J[进入拣货发货]\">graph TD\n  A[创建换货单] --&gt; B{目标变体可得?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[拒绝换货&lt;br/&gt;建议退款或候补]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[创建预占&lt;br/&gt;RESERVED]\n  D --&gt; E{逆向件到达?}\n  E --&gt;|超时未到| F[释放预占&lt;br/&gt;EXPIRED]\n  E --&gt;|到达并质检通过| G[预占转实占&lt;br/&gt;CONSUMED]\n  E --&gt;|到达但质检不通过| H[释放预占&lt;br/&gt;RELEASED]\n  D --&gt; I{客服拒绝/买家取消}\n  I --&gt;|是| H\n  G --&gt; J[进入拣货发货]</pre><h2 id=\"预占对象与可得量\">预占对象与可得量</h2><h3 id=\"预占粒度-变体-仓库\">预占粒度：变体 × 仓库</h3><p>预占要挂在<strong>变体 × 仓库</strong>这一粒度上，而不是挂在变体上。原因是跨境换货的目标仓库可能与原单不同（原单从海外仓发，换货可以从本地仓发，见 <a href=\"../reship-decision-scenario/reship-local-warehouse-fastpath\">本地仓直发/随箱补发快速通道</a>），而两个仓库的库存是独立池。把预占挂在变体粒度上会导致「A 仓有货但 B 仓没货」时系统误判可得。</p>\n<p>可得量（ATP）的表达式就是可售量减去有效预占：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ATP</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>on_hand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>committed</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munder><mtext>qty</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ATP}(v, w) = \\text{on\\_hand}(v, w) - \\text{committed}(v, w) - \\sum_{r \\in R_{v,w}} \\text{qty}(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ATP</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">on_hand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">committed</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5417em;vertical-align:-1.4917em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4917em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qty</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{v,w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该变体在该仓库上所有<strong>未过期且未结算</strong>的预占集合。这个求和里最容易出错的是「已过期但尚未被扫描释放」的那部分——它们不应该继续扣减 ATP，否则一次失败的定时任务会造成永久性的库存漏损。因此正确写法是：ATP 计算时按 <code>expires_at</code> 过滤，而清理任务只负责改变状态而不负责纠正数字。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预占状态</th>\n<th>是否扣减 ATP</th>\n<th>可否被新预占复用</th>\n<th>结束条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RESERVED</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>转 CONSUMED 或释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CONSUMED</td>\n<td>是（转实占）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>出库扣减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RELEASED</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>终态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXPIRED</td>\n<td>否（按时间过滤）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>终态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CANCELLED</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>终态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意 RESERVED 与 CONSUMED 都扣减 ATP，区别在账务语义：RESERVED 是「承诺但不计入成本」，CONSUMED 是「这批货已归属此单」。当逆向件质检不通过（比如买家退回的是不同商品），预占应当被释放而不是消耗——因为那件货并不能用来履约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预占表与时序约束\">预占表与时序约束</h2><h3 id=\"部分唯一索引为什么优于行级排他\">部分唯一索引为什么优于行级排他</h3><p>下面这张表用 <code>EXCLUDE USING gist</code> 表达「同一变体同一仓库的有效预占总量不超可售量」这类约束是做不到的（那是一个聚合约束，不是行间不重叠），但可以用它表达另一条真正有用的不变式：<strong>同一换货单在同一变体同一仓库上只能有一条未终结的预占</strong>。这是防重复预占的硬约束。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE stock_reservation (&#10;  reservation_id  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  variant_id      BIGINT      NOT NULL REFERENCES variant(variant_id),&#10;  warehouse_id    BIGINT      NOT NULL REFERENCES warehouse(warehouse_id),&#10;  qty             INTEGER     NOT NULL CHECK (qty &gt; 0),&#10;&#10;  source_type     TEXT        NOT NULL&#10;                  CHECK (source_type IN (&#39;SALES_ORDER&#39;,&#39;EXCHANGE&#39;,&#39;RESHIP&#39;)),&#10;  source_id       BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;&#10;  state           TEXT        NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;RESERVED&#39;&#10;                  CHECK (state IN&#10;                    (&#39;RESERVED&#39;,&#39;CONSUMED&#39;,&#39;RELEASED&#39;,&#39;EXPIRED&#39;,&#39;CANCELLED&#39;)),&#10;&#10;  reserved_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  expires_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  settled_at      TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  end_reason      TEXT,&#10;&#10;  CONSTRAINT reservation_window CHECK (expires_at &gt; reserved_at),&#10;  CONSTRAINT settled_has_reason CHECK (&#10;    (state IN (&#39;RESERVED&#39;) AND settled_at IS NULL AND end_reason IS NULL)&#10;    OR (state &lt;&gt; &#39;RESERVED&#39; AND settled_at IS NOT NULL AND end_reason IS NOT NULL)&#10;  )&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX one_live_reservation_per_source&#10;  ON stock_reservation (source_type, source_id, variant_id, warehouse_id)&#10;  WHERE state = &#39;RESERVED&#39;;&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX reservation_atp_lookup&#10;  ON stock_reservation (variant_id, warehouse_id, expires_at)&#10;  WHERE state IN (&#39;RESERVED&#39;,&#39;CONSUMED&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> stock_reservation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reservation_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  variant_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> variant(variant_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  warehouse_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse(warehouse_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_type     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (source_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SALES_ORDER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EXCHANGE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RESHIP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RESERVED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RESERVED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONSUMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EXPIRED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CANCELLED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reserved_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  settled_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  end_reason      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reservation_window </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_at),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settled_has_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RESERVED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settled_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> end_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RESERVED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settled_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> end_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> one_live_reservation_per_source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_reservation (source_type, source_id, variant_id, warehouse_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RESERVED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reservation_atp_lookup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_reservation (variant_id, warehouse_id, expires_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RESERVED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONSUMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里有两个设计选择值得说明。第一，<code>one_live_reservation_per_source</code> 是<strong>部分唯一索引</strong>（<code>WHERE state = &#39;RESERVED&#39;</code>），它只约束「活着」的预占，历史记录可以有多条——这正是我们想要的：允许重试，禁止并发重复。第二，<code>settled_has_reason</code> 把「终态必须记录结束原因」写进约束，直接服务于前面说的「任何预占都能回答它是怎么结束的」。结束原因用受控词表而不是自由文本，才能被统计。</p>\n<p>PostgreSQL 的 <code>EXCLUDE</code> 约束在这里用不上，但它在<strong>门槛有效期</strong>这类场景是正确工具：当你要表达「同一市场同一属性的门槛记录生效区间不重叠」时，<code>EXCLUDE USING gist (key WITH =, period WITH &amp;&amp;)</code> 是标准写法，其语义等价于 <code>UNIQUE (key, period WITHOUT OVERLAPS)</code>（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-createtable.html\">PostgreSQL CREATE TABLE 文档</a>）。库存预占需要的是聚合约束，正确做法是在写入路径上用「可售量 − 有效预占 ≥ 请求量」的条件更新来保证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE inventory&#10;SET    committed = committed + :qty&#10;WHERE  variant_id = :v AND warehouse_id = :w&#10;  AND  on_hand - committed &gt;= :qty&#10;RETURNING on_hand - committed AS atp_after;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    committed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> committed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  variant_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :w</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  on_hand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> committed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING on_hand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> committed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> atp_after;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条语句的收益在于它是<strong>原子的条件更新</strong>：如果返回零行，说明可得量不足，预占失败。它不依赖先读后写的检查，因此并发下不会超卖。这是把业务不变式下沉到数据库的正确方式，比在应用层加锁更可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逆向件回补-质检决定去向\">逆向件回补：质检决定去向</h2><p>换货的另一半是逆向件到达之后的处置。一个常见的错误是把回收件直接回补可售库存，理由是「东西没坏，还能卖」。这个假设在跨境场景下风险很高，因为原商品已经经历过一次国际运输与买家持有，其状态不再是出厂状态。</p>\n<p>正确的结构是<strong>回收件进入待检库存，由质检结果决定下一步</strong>：通过则回补可售，不通过则进入翻新、打折、报废或弃置流程。这个决策点必须显式建模，否则「回收了多少、其中多少能再卖」这两个数字就永远算不出来，而它们正是第 4 章成本度量的输入。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>质检结论</th>\n<th>库存去向</th>\n<th>是否可再售</th>\n<th>账务处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PASS_AS_NEW</td>\n<td>可售库存</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>无损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PASS_REPACK</td>\n<td>可售库存（换包装）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>包装成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REFURBISH</td>\n<td>翻新库存</td>\n<td>翻新后可</td>\n<td>翻新成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DAMAGED_RESALE</td>\n<td>残次品渠道</td>\n<td>折价</td>\n<td>折价损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SCRAP</td>\n<td>报废</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>全额损失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表里最该被设计进去的是 <code>PASS_AS_NEW</code> 与 <code>PASS_REPACK</code> 的区分。它们的库存去向相同（都是可售），但账务处理不同。如果系统只有「通过/不通过」两档，包装成本就会消失在售后成本科目里——不是账不平，而是这笔钱从此无法归因到具体原因上，也就无法通过改进包装来消除它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>换货<strong>必须预占而非后置校验</strong>，因为它的预占时长跨越逆向物流（常达 7–21 天），不预占会产生竞态。</li>\n<li>预占挂在 <strong>变体 × 仓库</strong> 粒度；可得量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ATP</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>on_hand</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>committed</mtext><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>有效预占</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ATP} = \\text{on\\_hand} - \\text{committed} - \\sum \\text{有效预占}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ATP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">on_hand</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">committed</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效预占</span></span></span></span></span></span>，计算时按到期时间过滤而不是依赖清理任务纠正数字。</li>\n<li>用<strong>部分唯一索引</strong>约束「同一来源同一变体同一仓库只有一条活预占」，允许重试但禁止并发重复。</li>\n<li>用<strong>原子的条件更新</strong>实现「可售量 − 有效预占 ≥ 请求量」，而不是应用层先读后写。</li>\n<li>逆向件<strong>不能直接回补可售</strong>，必须经质检分档；分档至少要区分「原样可售」与「换包装可售」，否则包装成本无法归因。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"换货库存预留与可得性（联034）","id":"换货库存预留与可得性-联034"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：换货为什么必须预占而非后置校验","id":"核心概念-换货为什么必须预占而非后置校验"},{"level":3,"text":"预占时长的结构性差异","id":"预占时长的结构性差异"},{"level":3,"text":"预占必须能解释自己的结束","id":"预占必须能解释自己的结束"},{"level":2,"text":"预占对象与可得量","id":"预占对象与可得量"},{"level":3,"text":"预占粒度：变体 × 仓库","id":"预占粒度-变体-仓库"},{"level":2,"text":"预占表与时序约束","id":"预占表与时序约束"},{"level":3,"text":"部分唯一索引为什么优于行级排他","id":"部分唯一索引为什么优于行级排他"},{"level":2,"text":"逆向件回补：质检决定去向","id":"逆向件回补-质检决定去向"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"同款/异款/码色换货交易建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/exchange-transaction-inventory/exchange-same-different-size-color"},"next":{"title":"换货价差结算与多退少补","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/exchange-transaction-inventory/exchange-price-difference-settle"}}